          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are familiar with all the members of your community and their typical movements, and you have learned how to apply these patterns outside those circles. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your Perception DC against someone attempting to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Lie] to you and to Perception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sense Motive] or to detect a creature trying to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Impersonate] someone they are not.</p>"
          },
