          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>While athamarus' natural pheromones are typically used for communication, you have developed yours into a defense mechanism to ward off foes. You emit a thick spray of defensive pheromones at an adjacent creature, who takes @Damage[(floor((@actor.level +1)/2)+1)d6[poison]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:class|basic] save against your class DC.</p>\n<p>At 3rd level and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
